  "reasoning": "Extensive scientific consensus from major health organizations (including the CDC, WHO, and NIH) and molecular biology literature confirms that mRNA COVID-19 vaccines do not alter, integrate into, or permanently change human DNA. Messenger RNA delivers temporary instructions to the cellular cytoplasm to produce the spike protein, triggering an immune response. The mRNA never enters the cell nucleus where DNA resides, cannot be converted into DNA without reverse transcriptase enzymes, and naturally degrades quickly within the cell. Claims suggesting genomic alteration have been widely debunked.",
